    "detailed_description": "Exploration Adventure Construction RPG<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>Gameplay Features<br>Build a team of sisters, find the ones that suit you best.<br>Sisters each have their own unique personalities for you to freely cultivate.<br>Three different sister abilities allow you, the brother, to train according to the adventure, creating your own unique lineup.<br><br>Multiple Stages Challenges, with different areas and adventures waiting for you to explore<br><br>Various exploration routes and strategies freely selectable, venture deeper to find more sisters.<br>Numerous events to strengthen bonds with sisters.<br>An abundance of items to enhance sisters, plus unique items that can be dragged into the scene to change exploration rules.<br>Collect memories with sisters and unlock items, making sisters stronger in the next round of the game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>Combat Features<br>Automated battles, allowing brothers to focus solely on exploration and nurturing more sisters.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>Convenient Features<br>Primarily keyboard-operated, move and explore with WASD or arrow keys, combined with left and right mouse clicks.<br>High-speed gameplay with full fast-forwarding capability.<br>Auto-save feature allows players to safely step away from the game at any time.",
    "about_the_game": "Exploration Adventure Construction RPG<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>Gameplay Features<br>Build a team of sisters, find the ones that suit you best.<br>Sisters each have their own unique personalities for you to freely cultivate.<br>Three different sister abilities allow you, the brother, to train according to the adventure, creating your own unique lineup.<br><br>Multiple Stages Challenges, with different areas and adventures waiting for you to explore<br><br>Various exploration routes and strategies freely selectable, venture deeper to find more sisters.<br>Numerous events to strengthen bonds with sisters.<br>An abundance of items to enhance sisters, plus unique items that can be dragged into the scene to change exploration rules.<br>Collect memories with sisters and unlock items, making sisters stronger in the next round of the game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>Combat Features<br>Automated battles, allowing brothers to focus solely on exploration and nurturing more sisters.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul>Convenient Features<br>Primarily keyboard-operated, move and explore with WASD or arrow keys, combined with left and right mouse clicks.<br>High-speed gameplay with full fast-forwarding capability.<br>Auto-save feature allows players to safely step away from the game at any time.",
